rán con alegría.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"El que sale llorando, llevando semilla para sembrar,","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ciertamente volverá con alegría, llevando sus gavillas.","poem":2}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/spa_blm/PSA/126.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/spa_blm/PSA/127.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/spa_blm/PSA/125.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":6}